<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>제로는 목표가 아닙니다.</h1><p class="pc-lead">잠재 상태는 개별적으로 탐색하며 차이로 계산하지 않습니다.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>개인 만족도: 0은 전혀 만족하지 않음, 10은 완전히 만족함. 임상 척도가 아닙니다.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">신체</p><h3>움직임과 편안함</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">현재</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">희망</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">잠재</span><div class="pc-unknown">미정</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">인지</p><h3>주의력</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">현재</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-1">희망</label><select id="pc-desired-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">잠재</span><div class="pc-unknown">미정</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">정서</p><h3>평온함과 여유</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-2">현재</label><select id="pc-current-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-2">희망</label><select id="pc-desired-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">잠재</span><div class="pc-unknown">미정</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">직업</p><h3>업무 자원</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-3">현재</label><select id="pc-current-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-3">희망</label><select id="pc-desired-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— 평가하지 않음</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">잠재</span><div class="pc-unknown">미정</div></div></div></div></div><p class="pc-note">잠재 상태는 개별적으로 탐색하며 차이로 계산하지 않습니다.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>초기화</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>기기에 저장</button></div><p class="pc-note">자동 전송 없음. 로컬 JSON 파일을 내보냅니다.</p></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">상황 상담</a></div></section></main>